In exercise of rule making power under Section 52 (2) (j), the Legal Metrology (Packaged Commodities) Rules, 2011 were made and notified under Section 52 (2)
(j) and (o). Rule 6 sub rule (1) prescribes that every package shall bear thereon or on label securely affixed thereto a definite claim on conspicuous declaration made in accordance with the provisions of this chapter i.e., Chapter No.2. Clause (a) of Rule 6 (1) deals with the name and address of the manufacturer or in case the manufacturer is not the packer, the name and address of the manufacturer and packer;
in case of imported package, the name and address of importer shall be mentioned.
